(p005_vacuum_ballistic_medium)
*title Vacuum ballistic convergence case
*atmos none
*earth spherical omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic
    alt=0 long=0 lat=0 vel=8000 gama=90 psi=90 time=0 mass=10
  *file ballistic.dat
    time alt rcm vel xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 ascent
    *integ dtprnt=10 dt=1.0
    *when time=200 stop
*end
